{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>運動達人廖慧儀（Jessica）向來熱愛健身，擁有令人羨慕的健美身材與古銅色蜜糖肌。近日她抓緊夏天的尾巴親近大海，於社交平台大方分享多張在沙灘拍攝的比堅尼靚相，向網民大派水著福利。相中的她除了展現零死角的結實線條，造型細節亦極具巧思，眼角貼上Bling Bling貼紙，少女感十足。她更以近鏡、俯拍及趴在沙灘大晒美背等多個角度取景，畫面極為養眼。</p><figure><img alt=\"廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121792225021952582136.jpeg/PWVp75H4d5aYr0g872TZXqlEEU965ax3p9IfmqfSH5o\"/><figcaption>廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121789007859712937246.jpeg/2_Kuzzi87bX-VUQr88VMeFMr0fUTeQLcE_IbYxPyG2M\"/><figcaption>廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"少女感十足！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121796683698176832697.jpeg/N_JovBq_mYHJznUfEJQnYV7t2gNPbCPMwqid_MKonfw\"/><figcaption>少女感十足！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬美背！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121790949822464609452.jpeg/UrlnbEim6zFPUY1MIxNcjJazeOJxRO5tgwIUMIMCFDA\"/><figcaption>大曬美背！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121788076593152356829.jpeg/9fNKZAcyVtPJkvomzqzJxVlxi2vmP4VpXe4ij13uIo8\"/><figcaption>廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><p>廖慧儀疑過份瘦削胸骨盡現惹關心</p><p>然而，相片曝光後卻意外引來部分網民關切。雖然廖慧儀的肌肉線條極為結實，但有眼利的網民留意到她俯拍時胸骨清晰可見，認為她近期似乎有些過瘦，紛紛在留言區表達擔心，勸她要多注意身體健康，不妨「食多啲」增添些許肉感。</p><figure><img alt=\"俯拍視角胸骨現形網民嗌食多啲。（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121799292686336152986.jpeg/kxwIOyfhvvt_PkA137RJl1bhH9bvEjLxuaz3Lbms9y0\"/><figcaption>俯拍視角胸骨現形網民嗌食多啲。（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121793927909376025947.jpeg/Cs2umLEs4iOlVAcKvsmdR3GRW1qYe-vBci5ponIuaaI\"/><figcaption>廖慧儀粉紅比堅尼靚相，大派水著福利！（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"胸骨顯露惹網民憂過瘦。（IG@newayyee_yoga）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1170121785643896832014295.jpeg/_XxcGkoNbCAgPPRN5OXkj_8GqT1flc9pLZLdFC2S3RQ\"/><figcaption>胸骨顯露惹網民憂過瘦。（IG@newayyee_yoga）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T15:18:16.096795+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":555,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}